      <span class="abstract-short has-text-grey-dark mathjax" id="2603.23910v1-abstract-short" style="display: inline;">
        Recent advances in large language models (<span class="search-hit mathjax">LLMs</span>) suggest strong potential for automating analog circuit design. Yet most&hellip;
        <a class="is-size-7" style="white-space: nowrap;" onclick="document.getElementById('2603.23910v1-abstract-full').style.display = 'inline'; document.getElementById('2603.23910v1-abstract-short').style.display = 'none';">&#9661; More</a>
