      <span class="abstract-short has-text-grey-dark mathjax" id="2603.23840v1-abstract-short" style="display: inline;">
        With the growing demand for intelligent in-vehicle experiences, vehicle-based <span class="search-hit mathjax">agents</span> are evolving from simple assistants to long-term companions. This evolution requires&hellip;
        <a class="is-size-7" style="white-space: nowrap;" onclick="document.getElementById('2603.23840v1-abstract-full').style.display = 'inline'; document.getElementById('2603.23840v1-abstract-short').style.display = 'none';">&#9661; More</a>
