        Improving GPU kernel efficiency is crucial for advancing AI systems. Recent work has explored leveraging large language models (<span class="search-hit mathjax">LLMs</span>) for GPU kernel generation and optimization. However, existing&hellip;
        <a class="is-size-7" style="white-space: nowrap;" onclick="document.getElementById('2603.10085v1-abstract-full').style.display = 'inline'; document.getElementById('2603.10085v1-abstract-short').style.display = 'none';">&#9661; More</a>
